(4879427, 708565, 60862, '<td valign="top">Duh!  Write the brief and *accidentally* hit the update button as you type.  Thanks, BTW, for memorializing that rarest of things: a home page with my image on it!<br/> <br/>Ok, about the image ... I like the B&amp;W treatment, but there''s too much stuff going on in the background, so my eye keeps wandering off of you and your work.  I wonder how it would''ve looked with a shallower DOF to help isolate you, or a lighting setup that kept the background in the dark?  Also, since this is advanced editing, you could''ve blurred it or darkened it.</td>', 'Duh!  Write the brief and *accidentally* hit the update button as you type.  Thanks, BTW, for memorializing that rarest of things: a home page with my image on it! Ok, about the image ... I like the B&W treatment, but there''s too much stuff going on in the background, so my eye keeps wandering off of you and your work.  I wonder how it would''ve looked with a shallower DOF to help isolate you, or a lighting setup that kept the background in the dark?  Also, since this is advanced editing, you could''ve blurred it or darkened it.', '2008-08-11 01:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879428, 708932, 88136, '<td valign="top">thats kinda scary actually</td>', 'thats kinda scary actually', '2008-08-11 01:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879429, 708410, 83313, '<td valign="top">Can I be the first to make the predictable and lame pun about throwing stones?<br/> <br/>Not sure what it is about this image. I want to really like it, but it''s not hitting me right. Might be one of those cases where a highly detailed image did not scale down to web size very well. Perhaps the high amount of detail, but no colors really stand out from everything else. Not really sure.</td>', 'Can I be the first to make the predictable and lame pun about throwing stones? Not sure what it is about this image. I want to really like it, but it''s not hitting me right. Might be one of those cases where a highly detailed image did not scale down to web size very well. Perhaps the high amount of detail, but no colors really stand out from everything else. Not really sure.', '2008-08-11 01:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
