(4879476, 708985, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice action capture, good composition, and I like the dirt flying.  However, and especially in advanced editing, you''d improve the shot by removing the large sensor dust spots and bringing some detail back into the clouds.</td>', 'Nice action capture, good composition, and I like the dirt flying.  However, and especially in advanced editing, you''d improve the shot by removing the large sensor dust spots and bringing some detail back into the clouds.', '2008-08-11 01:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
