(4879486, 709067, 89723, '<td valign="top">Your going the wrong way. :)</td>', 'Your going the wrong way. :)', '2008-08-11 01:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879488, 709131, 60862, '<td valign="top">So much to like here: the contrast between the bright, colorful book and the B&amp;W hands, the detalis in the jewelry, and the overall composition.<br/> <br/>But I''m left wondering whether that''s a plastic hand you''re holding (if it''s not, waaayyy too much noise reduction or blurring), and the jaggies on the book''s title are pretty big (try blurring them a little to take the edge off).</td>', 'So much to like here: the contrast between the bright, colorful book and the B&W hands, the detalis in the jewelry, and the overall composition. But I''m left wondering whether that''s a plastic hand you''re holding (if it''s not, waaayyy too much noise reduction or blurring), and the jaggies on the book''s title are pretty big (try blurring them a little to take the edge off).', '2008-08-11 01:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879489, 708841, 60173, '<td valign="top">I wonder how many people will realize this is a reflection. I only realized after trying to figure out what the bright white bit was in the lower left corner. <br/> <br/>This photo is almost a nightmare to me actually. I worked for a company that made RAM wafers that look much like what you''re holding. The bunny suits, oh god, the suits... Man, I hated that place!</td>', 'I wonder how many people will realize this is a reflection. I only realized after trying to figure out what the bright white bit was in the lower left corner.  This photo is almost a nightmare to me actually. I worked for a company that made RAM wafers that look much like what you''re holding. The bunny suits, oh god, the suits... Man, I hated that place!', '2008-08-11 01:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879490, 708895, 63503, '<td valign="top">This has got to be yours Remb. Wonderful picture, I''d give you a 10 but I am in this challenge, so, I am not voting.</td>', 'This has got to be yours Remb. Wonderful picture, I''d give you a 10 but I am in this challenge, so, I am not voting.', '2008-08-11 01:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
