(4879512, 707489, 60862, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  I think I''d like it better as an image without the branches, which are just one element too many in an otherwise interesting story that leaves me wanting to know more.  Why is she sitting on railroad tracks?  Why did she choose to do "love me, love me not" in that spot?  What does the storm represent?<br/> <br/>For this challenge, though, it seems an odd combination, and florists generally don''t spend their time pulling flowers apart.</td>', 'Hmm.  I think I''d like it better as an image without the branches, which are just one element too many in an otherwise interesting story that leaves me wanting to know more.  Why is she sitting on railroad tracks?  Why did she choose to do "love me, love me not" in that spot?  What does the storm represent? For this challenge, though, it seems an odd combination, and florists generally don''t spend their time pulling flowers apart.', '2008-08-11 01:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879515, 707631, 3569, '<td valign="top">lumberjack?</td>', 'lumberjack?', '2008-08-11 01:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
