(4879557, 708770, 83313, '<td valign="top">Oops, saw this on your Flickr page earlier this evening. Normally I would skip a vote on such a shot, but as a self portrait, it''s not anonymous anyway. (Many of the entries in this challenge will be far from anonymous!)<br/> <br/>A really successful illustration of an idea. Not a "wow" shot, but then, it was not meant to be one. I''m weary of housework just from looking at this! My only quibble is the noticeable skew. Good job.</td>', 'Oops, saw this on your Flickr page earlier this evening. Normally I would skip a vote on such a shot, but as a self portrait, it''s not anonymous anyway. (Many of the entries in this challenge will be far from anonymous!) A really successful illustration of an idea. Not a "wow" shot, but then, it was not meant to be one. I''m weary of housework just from looking at this! My only quibble is the noticeable skew. Good job.', '2008-08-11 02:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
