(4879574, 709101, 60862, '<td valign="top">A nice effort on the classic ad for the Marines.  The sword gets lost, though, and makes me want to move it out of the way so I can see you.  I like the side lighting, but it''d be good to bring some detail back into the blown highlights in processing.  Same goes for lost detail in the black cloth (I''m looking at this on a calibrated CRT screen, so it may be brighter on an LCD).<br/> <br/>At any rate, thanks for serving!</td>', 'A nice effort on the classic ad for the Marines.  The sword gets lost, though, and makes me want to move it out of the way so I can see you.  I like the side lighting, but it''d be good to bring some detail back into the blown highlights in processing.  Same goes for lost detail in the black cloth (I''m looking at this on a calibrated CRT screen, so it may be brighter on an LCD). At any rate, thanks for serving!', '2008-08-11 02:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
