(4881482, 709007, 67553, '<td valign="top">Been looking at this one for a while.  I like the idea, but would have preferred to have the person more prominent in the image.  The motion blur in the grass is a bit distracting.  As landscapes go, it''s a little drab, but the juxtaposition of the high tech in the natural environment is a good one.  (Oh, and I bumped you up one just because you got me to look long enough to notice the duck.)  :)</td>', 'Been looking at this one for a while.  I like the idea, but would have preferred to have the person more prominent in the image.  The motion blur in the grass is a bit distracting.  As landscapes go, it''s a little drab, but the juxtaposition of the high tech in the natural environment is a good one.  (Oh, and I bumped you up one just because you got me to look long enough to notice the duck.)  :)', '2008-08-11 20:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
