(4881532, 708932, 67553, '<td valign="top">I love the detail here.  The face on the badge and the blur of the fingers as they type. This was a great idea for a shot.  It could have only been enhanced by setting it inside a cubicle lit with harsh fluorescent lights.</td>', 'I love the detail here.  The face on the badge and the blur of the fingers as they type. This was a great idea for a shot.  It could have only been enhanced by setting it inside a cubicle lit with harsh fluorescent lights.', '2008-08-11 21:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
