(4881579, 708846, 67553, '<td valign="top">This seems a little too staged for my taste.  While I really like the idea of the shot, I wonder if you might have gotten a better composition by just lowering the camera angle and tightening up on an over the shoulder view to emphasize the stained glass.<br/> <br/>Your lighting is beautiful, and hard to match anywhere else.</td>', 'This seems a little too staged for my taste.  While I really like the idea of the shot, I wonder if you might have gotten a better composition by just lowering the camera angle and tightening up on an over the shoulder view to emphasize the stained glass. Your lighting is beautiful, and hard to match anywhere else.', '2008-08-11 21:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881600, 708701, 67553, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites in this challenge, though it appears that you''re lecturing to an empty classroom.  :)  (No worries, I''ve been known to do that on occasion.)  Still, I like the effective use of a limited DOF in order to draw attention into the subject.  Well done.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites in this challenge, though it appears that you''re lecturing to an empty classroom.  :)  (No worries, I''ve been known to do that on occasion.)  Still, I like the effective use of a limited DOF in order to draw attention into the subject.  Well done.', '2008-08-11 22:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881604, 708884, 67553, '<td valign="top">Ok, I''m still chuckling.  :)  Where do I send my resume?  This is a really well thought out concept, and a great shot.</td>', 'Ok, I''m still chuckling.  :)  Where do I send my resume?  This is a really well thought out concept, and a great shot.', '2008-08-11 22:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881613, 708770, 67553, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a certain "Morning" shot I saw a while back.  A really honest and lighthearted look into real life.  I hope this one does at least as well in this challenge as that one did.</td>', 'This reminds me of a certain "Morning" shot I saw a while back.  A really honest and lighthearted look into real life.  I hope this one does at least as well in this challenge as that one did.', '2008-08-11 22:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881622, 709134, 67553, '<td valign="top">The hand in the frame actually takes away from this one in my opinion.  The thumb is slightly OOF and detracts from the wonderful colors and the sharp, beautifully focused, well lit microscope.</td>', 'The hand in the frame actually takes away from this one in my opinion.  The thumb is slightly OOF and detracts from the wonderful colors and the sharp, beautifully focused, well lit microscope.', '2008-08-11 22:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881629, 708207, 67553, '<td valign="top">The possibilities here are endless and wonderful.  The idea of getting an up close view looking down on these guys while they wash windows hundreds of feet above the street is the first one that springs to mind.  As it is, I''m afraid that there is not a lot about this image to make it really stand out.</td>', 'The possibilities here are endless and wonderful.  The idea of getting an up close view looking down on these guys while they wash windows hundreds of feet above the street is the first one that springs to mind.  As it is, I''m afraid that there is not a lot about this image to make it really stand out.', '2008-08-11 22:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881631, 708816, 67553, '<td valign="top">I love the creativity in this one.</td>', 'I love the creativity in this one.', '2008-08-11 22:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881633, 708519, 15711, '<td valign="top">I can almost smell them from here.  This might be a fun study in BW too after playing with levels and curves. :~)</td>', 'I can almost smell them from here.  This might be a fun study in BW too after playing with levels and curves. :~)', '2008-08-11 22:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881634, 708841, 15711, '<td valign="top">I wish I knew what those white things were on the left and right.  I''m certain afterwards, you can explain. :~)</td>', 'I wish I knew what those white things were on the left and right.  I''m certain afterwards, you can explain. :~)', '2008-08-11 22:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881635, 708903, 67553, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet dynamic and well lit.  Nice job.</td>', 'Simple, yet dynamic and well lit.  Nice job.', '2008-08-11 22:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881636, 708881, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the centering of you behind the mast.  Something real appealing about this shot. It''d be cool in BW with some contrast and level adjustments too. Good luck. :~)</td>', 'I like the centering of you behind the mast.  Something real appealing about this shot. It''d be cool in BW with some contrast and level adjustments too. Good luck. :~)', '2008-08-11 22:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881640, 708377, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of it - my favorite part is the thin rims of your glasses in silhouette. I think I might have cropped out part of the brown area at top and bottom but I still think the shot is appealing.</td>', 'I like the feel of it - my favorite part is the thin rims of your glasses in silhouette. I think I might have cropped out part of the brown area at top and bottom but I still think the shot is appealing.', '2008-08-11 22:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881641, 709134, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice focus.  I''m sure the purple overtones are significant but wonder if your hand were less so, if that would look more "real" or fake for having adjusted it.</td>', 'Nice focus.  I''m sure the purple overtones are significant but wonder if your hand were less so, if that would look more "real" or fake for having adjusted it.', '2008-08-11 22:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881643, 708932, 15711, '<td valign="top">You''ve got some fast long fingers. LOL  This is a hoot and the name tag cracks me up.</td>', 'You''ve got some fast long fingers. LOL  This is a hoot and the name tag cracks me up.', '2008-08-11 22:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881656, 709110, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretation of an occupation. If there was a shoehorn award, I would give it to you, but it''s such a creative interpretation that I just can''t ding you for it!</td>', 'Interesting interpretation of an occupation. If there was a shoehorn award, I would give it to you, but it''s such a creative interpretation that I just can''t ding you for it!', '2008-08-11 22:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881657, 707632, 84438, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!!</td>', 'Fantastic!!', '2008-08-11 22:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881661, 708482, 9576, '<td valign="top">Nice hair ;-)</td>', 'Nice hair ;-)', '2008-08-11 22:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881662, 708783, 83313, '<td valign="top">What a powerful image! A little overhsharpened on the shoulder is my only nitpick, and that is a minor nitpick.</td>', 'What a powerful image! A little overhsharpened on the shoulder is my only nitpick, and that is a minor nitpick.', '2008-08-11 22:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881663, 707489, 9576, '<td valign="top">shut win this 10++ ;-)</td>', 'shut win this 10++ ;-)', '2008-08-11 22:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881664, 708895, 9576, '<td valign="top">Very nice 10</td>', 'Very nice 10', '2008-08-11 22:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881665, 708767, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ew. Great image, though.</td>', 'Ew. Great image, though.', '2008-08-11 22:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881669, 708903, 9576, '<td valign="top">A better background would make this one a lot better <br/>maybe a white one to give the glean feeling more ???</td>', 'A better background would make this one a lot better maybe a white one to give the glean feeling more ???', '2008-08-11 22:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881677, 708944, 67237, '<td valign="top">great DOF here!!</td>', 'great DOF here!!', '2008-08-11 22:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881680, 707632, 9576, '<td valign="top">very goooood on top 3 I score it a 10+</td>', 'very goooood on top 3 I score it a 10+', '2008-08-11 22:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881682, 709101, 9576, '<td valign="top">9+</td>', '9+', '2008-08-11 22:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881686, 708767, 9576, '<td valign="top">;-)</td>', ';-)', '2008-08-11 22:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881696, 709069, 67553, '<td valign="top">This is a well thought out and wonderfully composed image.  Your processing has managed to convey exactly the sense of dreaminess your title suggests.</td>', 'This is a well thought out and wonderfully composed image.  Your processing has managed to convey exactly the sense of dreaminess your title suggests.', '2008-08-11 22:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881703, 708881, 67553, '<td valign="top">I like the way you managed to expose properly for both sky and sea.  The technicals of this shot are very good.  I can''t help but feel, however that this is a snapshot.  I think that feeling is based only on the lovely woman smiling directly into the camera, but it''s there nonetheless.</td>', 'I like the way you managed to expose properly for both sky and sea.  The technicals of this shot are very good.  I can''t help but feel, however that this is a snapshot.  I think that feeling is based only on the lovely woman smiling directly into the camera, but it''s there nonetheless.', '2008-08-11 22:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881706, 708843, 67553, '<td valign="top">And a very good one if this image is indicative of the quality of your work.  :)</td>', 'And a very good one if this image is indicative of the quality of your work.  :)', '2008-08-11 22:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881707, 708816, 82707, '<td valign="top">LOL! Quirky! DOF a little shallow on the writing, but you may prefer it that way.</td>', 'LOL! Quirky! DOF a little shallow on the writing, but you may prefer it that way.', '2008-08-11 22:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881710, 706525, 67553, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful portrait that deserves a place of honor over your mantle.  Beautifully done, and I might have to PM you for tips on getting kids to stay still long enough for a shot like this.  The lighting is wonderful and the B&amp;W processing is wonderfully done.  One of very few 10''s I give out.</td>', 'This is a beautiful portrait that deserves a place of honor over your mantle.  Beautifully done, and I might have to PM you for tips on getting kids to stay still long enough for a shot like this.  The lighting is wonderful and the B&W processing is wonderfully done.  One of very few 10''s I give out.', '2008-08-11 22:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881712, 708783, 67553, '<td valign="top">Superb.  The emotion and strength really shine through in this image.  Well done.</td>', 'Superb.  The emotion and strength really shine through in this image.  Well done.', '2008-08-11 23:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881715, 708335, 82707, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait shot, just a hint of reflection on the glasses, and I probably would have preferred to see the arm in a slightly different position.</td>', 'Nice portrait shot, just a hint of reflection on the glasses, and I probably would have preferred to see the arm in a slightly different position.', '2008-08-11 23:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881717, 708783, 82707, '<td valign="top">Lovely action shot!  Nicely processed.</td>', 'Lovely action shot!  Nicely processed.', '2008-08-11 23:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881725, 709067, 82707, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but overall the focus appears to be a little soft.</td>', 'Nice idea, but overall the focus appears to be a little soft.', '2008-08-11 23:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881734, 707033, 82707, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a room with a view!  Nice image!</td>', 'Now that''s a room with a view!  Nice image!', '2008-08-11 23:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881742, 708801, 82707, '<td valign="top">I love the colourful background.  Good effort on the panning!</td>', 'I love the colourful background.  Good effort on the panning!', '2008-08-11 23:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881754, 708870, 82707, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and those blue eyes are mesmerising!  Lovely image!</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and those blue eyes are mesmerising!  Lovely image!', '2008-08-11 23:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881761, 708903, 82707, '<td valign="top">:D If this doesn''t do so well, it would be because of the shuddering painful memories that it creates for a lot of people.  I think it is a very good image, (painful memories aside), and I wish you luck!</td>', ':D If this doesn''t do so well, it would be because of the shuddering painful memories that it creates for a lot of people.  I think it is a very good image, (painful memories aside), and I wish you luck!', '2008-08-11 23:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881774, 708800, 82707, '<td valign="top">Great image.  I love the creativity in the setup, and the lighting!  I''d say ''Spot On''.</td>', 'Great image.  I love the creativity in the setup, and the lighting!  I''d say ''Spot On''.', '2008-08-11 23:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881782, 708770, 82707, '<td valign="top">LOL! I love the darkness and the slightly crooked crop, and the cat is just perfect, not to mention the excellent model!  Good luck!</td>', 'LOL! I love the darkness and the slightly crooked crop, and the cat is just perfect, not to mention the excellent model!  Good luck!', '2008-08-11 23:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881867, 707943, 70514, '<td valign="top">Man!  You''ve just got the studio thing down!  Love the conversion, your best SP yet, imo.  I guess the only thing distracting are the smudge marks at the bottom of your trombone.  I don''t know if there''s any way around something like that though.  Wonderfully crisp and so nicely lit.</td>', 'Man!  You''ve just got the studio thing down!  Love the conversion, your best SP yet, imo.  I guess the only thing distracting are the smudge marks at the bottom of your trombone.  I don''t know if there''s any way around something like that though.  Wonderfully crisp and so nicely lit.', '2008-08-12 00:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881868, 708812, 70514, '<td valign="top">I love the image, you''ve really done a wonderful job getting your point across. Great in b/w.</td>', 'I love the image, you''ve really done a wonderful job getting your point across. Great in b/w.', '2008-08-12 00:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881873, 708207, 70514, '<td valign="top">Very cool and abstract.  Took me a second, I was so in awe of the windows...</td>', 'Very cool and abstract.  Took me a second, I was so in awe of the windows...', '2008-08-12 00:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881875, 708615, 70514, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful and rich picture to go with such a flower.</td>', 'What a beautiful and rich picture to go with such a flower.', '2008-08-12 00:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881880, 709131, 70514, '<td valign="top">I almost feel that the book is large enough that the selec. desat doesn''t quite work for me here.  There is enough white on the book, I think the title would''ve stood out wonderfully on it''s own without pulling in the orange-red coloring.  I love the image of the hands though. Great in b/w otherwise.</td>', 'I almost feel that the book is large enough that the selec. desat doesn''t quite work for me here.  There is enough white on the book, I think the title would''ve stood out wonderfully on it''s own without pulling in the orange-red coloring.  I love the image of the hands though. Great in b/w otherwise.', '2008-08-12 00:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881882, 708701, 70514, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and dof.</td>', 'Great perspective and dof.', '2008-08-12 00:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881889, 709133, 70514, '<td valign="top">Those stacks of books made me a bit nauseous.  <br/> <br/>Great composition, nice clearly lit and sharp image.</td>', 'Those stacks of books made me a bit nauseous.   Great composition, nice clearly lit and sharp image.', '2008-08-12 00:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881904, 709121, 70514, '<td valign="top">Dramatic.  Nice.</td>', 'Dramatic.  Nice.', '2008-08-12 00:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881911, 708770, 70514, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if it''s the pose, the clothes, the co-stars, or the processing, but you''ve captured it perfectly!</td>', 'I''m not sure if it''s the pose, the clothes, the co-stars, or the processing, but you''ve captured it perfectly!', '2008-08-12 00:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881986, 708769, 42135, '<td valign="top">Very nice b&amp;w conversion!</td>', 'Very nice b&w conversion!', '2008-08-12 01:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4881988, 709122, 42135, '<td valign="top">I like the action feel</td>', 'I like the action feel', '2008-08-12 01:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
