(4882207, 708783, 75034, '<td valign="top">Leo, this is fantastic. What a great shot. I''m so glad you had time to do a shot for this challenge and I''m even happier that I was able to find what one was yours. I would have missed it but I saw that goofy look on your face when I told you I lost a foot from my tripod the day we went out shooting waterfalls.<br/> <br/>I hope to see this one on the front page, you really stroked this one for what it''s worth.<br/> <br/>Good luck with this one.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Leo, this is fantastic. What a great shot. I''m so glad you had time to do a shot for this challenge and I''m even happier that I was able to find what one was yours. I would have missed it but I saw that goofy look on your face when I told you I lost a foot from my tripod the day we went out shooting waterfalls. I hope to see this one on the front page, you really stroked this one for what it''s worth. Good luck with this one. MAX!', '2008-08-12 02:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
