(4883012, 708207, 811, '<td valign="top">The perspective on this is almost dizzy-ing.  Took me  a second or two to orient myself.</td>', 'The perspective on this is almost dizzy-ing.  Took me  a second or two to orient myself.', '2008-08-12 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4883013, 706525, 811, '<td valign="top">shew.  i figured the toothfairy would make an appearance.  Lovely shot.</td>', 'shew.  i figured the toothfairy would make an appearance.  Lovely shot.', '2008-08-12 14:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4883018, 709121, 83313, '<td valign="top">Different and interesting. Is that the warm glow of a monitor displaying DPC that is providing the light?</td>', 'Different and interesting. Is that the warm glow of a monitor displaying DPC that is providing the light?', '2008-08-12 14:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4883020, 708812, 83313, '<td valign="top">So, you act like you have a job? You probably spend more time auditioning and marketing yourself than actually working. I suppose that''s just the deal for such a career.</td>', 'So, you act like you have a job? You probably spend more time auditioning and marketing yourself than actually working. I suppose that''s just the deal for such a career.', '2008-08-12 14:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4883023, 708328, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and tones in this. I''m curious if it was all existing light, or if you added to it.</td>', 'Nice lighting and tones in this. I''m curious if it was all existing light, or if you added to it.', '2008-08-12 14:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4883027, 708782, 83313, '<td valign="top">Pretty good overall. I like the perspective. A touch of motion blur, probably unavoidable, and the tip of his head is slightly cut off. I''m surely not the first to point those out.</td>', 'Pretty good overall. I like the perspective. A touch of motion blur, probably unavoidable, and the tip of his head is slightly cut off. I''m surely not the first to point those out.', '2008-08-12 14:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4883028, 709101, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like a recruiting poster. Nice work on this. Only minor nitpick is the very tip of his hat being cut off at the top of the frame.</td>', 'Looks like a recruiting poster. Nice work on this. Only minor nitpick is the very tip of his hat being cut off at the top of the frame.', '2008-08-12 14:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4883031, 708998, 90806, '<td valign="top">Cool reflective detail.  The smoke gets lost a bit with the white background, but other parts of the image have great contrast with that background.  Nice pic.</td>', 'Cool reflective detail.  The smoke gets lost a bit with the white background, but other parts of the image have great contrast with that background.  Nice pic.', '2008-08-12 14:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4883033, 709117, 90806, '<td valign="top">You taste butterflies?</td>', 'You taste butterflies?', '2008-08-12 14:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4883038, 708983, 83313, '<td valign="top">So, is that a dream job? I don''t have the patience for elaborate computer games, myself. I like to spend 5 minutes blasting a few aliens and be done.<br/> <br/>Not really thrilled with this shot, I''m afraid. Though I realize they represent video game inputs, The RCA jacks don''t convey much to me or hold my interest, and there''s a yellowish cast to the image. The foil does not do much either. It does not seem to be related to either the title or the object.</td>', 'So, is that a dream job? I don''t have the patience for elaborate computer games, myself. I like to spend 5 minutes blasting a few aliens and be done. Not really thrilled with this shot, I''m afraid. Though I realize they represent video game inputs, The RCA jacks don''t convey much to me or hold my interest, and there''s a yellowish cast to the image. The foil does not do much either. It does not seem to be related to either the title or the object.', '2008-08-12 14:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4883148, 708770, 28742, '<td valign="top">"Good morning, Ma''am, if I could just have a moment of your time to tell you about the magical wonder of our cleaning products..."<br/> <br/>...but I can see you are getting ready to vacuum the cat, so I''ll come back later. :)</td>', '"Good morning, Ma''am, if I could just have a moment of your time to tell you about the magical wonder of our cleaning products..." ...but I can see you are getting ready to vacuum the cat, so I''ll come back later. :)', '2008-08-12 16:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4883151, 708565, 28742, '<td valign="top">Update the brief and write your score! :)</td>', 'Update the brief and write your score! :)', '2008-08-12 16:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
