(4883158, 709002, 28742, '<td valign="top">Outstanding! And not even scary. I can see this on the front page - it''s already got the blue, red and yellow to match the ribbons. :) Best of luck!</td>', 'Outstanding! And not even scary. I can see this on the front page - it''s already got the blue, red and yellow to match the ribbons. :) Best of luck!', '2008-08-12 16:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
