(4883284, 709101, 66310, '<td valign="top">I really like most of this shot. the hand and sword being up around your face makes it a bit too "busy" for my taste. Thank you for your service, and stay safe!</td>', 'I really like most of this shot. the hand and sword being up around your face makes it a bit too "busy" for my taste. Thank you for your service, and stay safe!', '2008-08-12 17:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
