(4884598, 708532, 68573, '<td valign="top">Nice idea to convey your message.</td>', 'Nice idea to convey your message.', '2008-08-13 02:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4884599, 708936, 88136, '<td valign="top">very impressive. these soldier photos make me so proud, you captured a fabulous thing here</td>', 'very impressive. these soldier photos make me so proud, you captured a fabulous thing here', '2008-08-13 02:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4884611, 709121, 93478, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of the profile and how the falling strands of hair match the downward gaze.  Perhaps the black hood could have been a different color from the background because it appears the head is squished between two walls or floating in space.  The faint threading isn''t enough to identify it as clothing.</td>', 'I like the choice of the profile and how the falling strands of hair match the downward gaze.  Perhaps the black hood could have been a different color from the background because it appears the head is squished between two walls or floating in space.  The faint threading isn''t enough to identify it as clothing.', '2008-08-13 02:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4884660, 708685, 93478, '<td valign="top">The subject''s expression is too serious.  Also, the smoke is too distracting.  I assume its supposed to be steam but the folded arms and uniform suggest its condensation from the cold.</td>', 'The subject''s expression is too serious.  Also, the smoke is too distracting.  I assume its supposed to be steam but the folded arms and uniform suggest its condensation from the cold.', '2008-08-13 02:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4884675, 709067, 93478, '<td valign="top">Is this a race or a demolition derby?  I think a better shot would have had them all going in the same direction.  Also, the focus seems to be somewhere between the 03 and the 31 cars.</td>', 'Is this a race or a demolition derby?  I think a better shot would have had them all going in the same direction.  Also, the focus seems to be somewhere between the 03 and the 31 cars.', '2008-08-13 02:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4884689, 709133, 93478, '<td valign="top">Fewer books and more attention on the character pieces (rubiks cube, aquarium, other obscured objects) would have made this a more interesting shot.  I do like the wide-angle, however.</td>', 'Fewer books and more attention on the character pieces (rubiks cube, aquarium, other obscured objects) would have made this a more interesting shot.  I do like the wide-angle, however.', '2008-08-13 02:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
