(4885535, 708987, 88899, '<td valign="top">Wow! Very good! I love the darkness of the clouds and the black and white feel of doom yet there is a sign. Signs are important in this world. They warn of danger and keep us on the right track. <br/>Too bad the signs that lead us in life are purposely getting blocked and turned around. No one knows where to look anymore for help. Well soon enough the one that is doing it will be destroyed.</td>', 'Wow! Very good! I love the darkness of the clouds and the black and white feel of doom yet there is a sign. Signs are important in this world. They warn of danger and keep us on the right track. Too bad the signs that lead us in life are purposely getting blocked and turned around. No one knows where to look anymore for help. Well soon enough the one that is doing it will be destroyed.', '2008-08-13 11:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
