(4891154, 708207, 97166, '<td valign="top">Going on a second pass of my lower votes, and I''m forced to bump this one up. Although I''m still not a giant fan of the angle you''ve chosen (I don''t get a real sense of "occupation" here, as the person(s) that are doing the job are pretty hidden, even in the reflections), the shot has enough to stand itself on a good technical level.  In a challenge having to do with lines, or patterns, or something, this would be a bit stronger.  Here, it just doesn''t have enough of a tie-in for me.</td>', 'Going on a second pass of my lower votes, and I''m forced to bump this one up. Although I''m still not a giant fan of the angle you''ve chosen (I don''t get a real sense of "occupation" here, as the person(s) that are doing the job are pretty hidden, even in the reflections), the shot has enough to stand itself on a good technical level.  In a challenge having to do with lines, or patterns, or something, this would be a bit stronger.  Here, it just doesn''t have enough of a tie-in for me.', '2008-08-15 22:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
