(4894733, 706525, 3020, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot and idea Timfy, it truly conveys peace, safety, comfort, and love. :)<br/> <br/>PS- I have to say again, excellent shot, favorited.<br/> <br/>PPS- I wanted to tag on that I was looking through your profile and I noticed on one of your photos you commented that people are probably getting sick of seeing your kids. I think you are being too hard on good ole DPC, I''m sure we will all find them absolutely adorable forever... anyone who doesn''t is a stinky face... or at least until the teen years hit, black lipstick, nose rings, hehehe...<br/> <br/>PPPS- My mother wanted me to personally tell you "Wow, that is, that should have got first place. That photo is probably one of the best four I''ve seen on this site. That is just so perfect. Hey, you should tell him that, can you leave him a comment?"<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-19 11:18:34.</i></td>', 'Excellent shot and idea Timfy, it truly conveys peace, safety, comfort, and love. :) PS- I have to say again, excellent shot, favorited. PPS- I wanted to tag on that I was looking through your profile and I noticed on one of your photos you commented that people are probably getting sick of seeing your kids. I think you are being too hard on good ole DPC, I''m sure we will all find them absolutely adorable forever... anyone who doesn''t is a stinky face... or at least until the teen years hit, black lipstick, nose rings, hehehe... PPPS- My mother wanted me to personally tell you "Wow, that is, that should have got first place. That photo is probably one of the best four I''ve seen on this site. That is just so perfect. Hey, you should tell him that, can you leave him a comment?"', '2008-08-18 03:10:19.000000', '2008-08-19 12:18:34.000000', 0),
