(4894879, 708843, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great composition, sense of scale and presence!<br/>Congrats on 2nd place! Perfect shutter speed too.</td>', 'Great composition, sense of scale and presence!Congrats on 2nd place! Perfect shutter speed too.', '2008-08-18 06:33:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4894883, 708895, 19708, '<td valign="top">It''s a pen!<br/>(<i>I scratched my head trying to figure out what it was - looked like an eye</i>)<br/>Congrats on yet another blue ribbon Irene!<br/> <br/>My only nit here is that it lacks soul. Creative, beautifully composed &amp; lit, but it''s sterile (<i>to me anyway</i>) <br/>Come on out in the real world and take snapshots with the rest of us - lol.<br/></td>', 'It''s a pen!(I scratched my head trying to figure out what it was - looked like an eye)Congrats on yet another blue ribbon Irene! My only nit here is that it lacks soul. Creative, beautifully composed & lit, but it''s sterile (to me anyway) Come on out in the real world and take snapshots with the rest of us - lol.', '2008-08-18 06:37:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4894887, 708482, 19708, '<td valign="top">"Just"<br/>HA - nothing "just" about you!<br/>I nearly didn''t recognize you in clothes, but I suspected it was you cuz'' your hair''s on fire!</td>', '"Just"HA - nothing "just" about you!I nearly didn''t recognize you in clothes, but I suspected it was you cuz'' your hair''s on fire!', '2008-08-18 06:39:46.000000', NULL, 0),
