(4895201, 709101, 50695, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6. It''s an excellent portrait. I would have scored it higher except I didn''t like the composition. Some of the things that one learns at DPC are wrong! ;) When deciding on your crop/composition, look not at the subject but at the shapes and lines. Composition is about form, not content. (it is possible to use composition to convey themes, like isolation, community, dominance, etc., but even so you do it with forms.)</td>', 'I gave this a 6. It''s an excellent portrait. I would have scored it higher except I didn''t like the composition. Some of the things that one learns at DPC are wrong! ;) When deciding on your crop/composition, look not at the subject but at the shapes and lines. Composition is about form, not content. (it is possible to use composition to convey themes, like isolation, community, dominance, etc., but even so you do it with forms.)', '2008-08-18 11:24:58.000000', NULL, 0),
