(4895867, 708937, 97166, '<td valign="top">Following up on my comment:<br/> <br/>I see someone else had the same suggestion I did. I wanted to point it out though, because it''s something I find myself doing a lot, and I like to pass on my experiences when I can.<br/> <br/>So I hope I helped somewhat.  The expression on the dog, however, is really great.</td>', 'Following up on my comment: I see someone else had the same suggestion I did. I wanted to point it out though, because it''s something I find myself doing a lot, and I like to pass on my experiences when I can. So I hope I helped somewhat.  The expression on the dog, however, is really great.', '2008-08-18 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4895871, 706525, 63812, '<td valign="top">Congratulations for the warmest photo of this challenge. (voted 10) Fuller of tenderness, flood of emotions, including the smile that your son tries to contain. Very sweet. Technically perfect, perfect illumination. Wonderful photographer and wonderful father. Congrats for the ribbon and for your beautiful family.</td>', 'Congratulations for the warmest photo of this challenge. (voted 10) Fuller of tenderness, flood of emotions, including the smile that your son tries to contain. Very sweet. Technically perfect, perfect illumination. Wonderful photographer and wonderful father. Congrats for the ribbon and for your beautiful family.', '2008-08-18 17:21:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4895873, 709013, 97166, '<td valign="top">Following up on my comment:<br/> <br/>I''m sure that my comment didn''t help much, but just wanted to pass on how I was feeling. <br/> <br/>Perhaps the fact that it moved me to comment at all says something.</td>', 'Following up on my comment: I''m sure that my comment didn''t help much, but just wanted to pass on how I was feeling.  Perhaps the fact that it moved me to comment at all says something.', '2008-08-18 17:21:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4895879, 708870, 97166, '<td valign="top">Following up on my comment:<br/> <br/>Seems that the only comments you didn''t mark as helpful were the only ones that were actually trying to help a little. Shame, that.<br/> <br/>I know it''s hard to separate your love for your child from the objectivity of your art, but it''ll actually help you very much in the long run if you can manage to do so.<br/> <br/>This photo could have benefited a lot from just a very little too. More use of natural light, more attention to toning and contrast, a little more experimentation with angles and pose.<br/> <br/>Strive to improve always.</td>', 'Following up on my comment: Seems that the only comments you didn''t mark as helpful were the only ones that were actually trying to help a little. Shame, that. I know it''s hard to separate your love for your child from the objectivity of your art, but it''ll actually help you very much in the long run if you can manage to do so. This photo could have benefited a lot from just a very little too. More use of natural light, more attention to toning and contrast, a little more experimentation with angles and pose. Strive to improve always.', '2008-08-18 17:25:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4895883, 709099, 97166, '<td valign="top">Following up on my comment:<br/> <br/>Not much to add to my original comment. Can''t win them all! :)</td>', 'Following up on my comment: Not much to add to my original comment. Can''t win them all! :)', '2008-08-18 17:28:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4895886, 708895, 25166, '<td valign="top">I am going to ask the SC to drug test you! I think your taking performance enhancing substances! Only joking - what and amazing run you are having. Another fantastic photograph. Well done!</td>', 'I am going to ask the SC to drug test you! I think your taking performance enhancing substances! Only joking - what and amazing run you are having. Another fantastic photograph. Well done!', '2008-08-18 17:30:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4895895, 709040, 97166, '<td valign="top">Following up on my comment:<br/> <br/>Sorry about the rather opinionated comment. I''ve been trying to word my comments better than the one I left you, and meant to come back and refine it, but somehow missed doing so.<br/> <br/>What most of your commenters had to say rings true.  The tilt is a distraction here, and the photo could have been much stronger with just a little change of perspective, or even just a rotation in post-process. <br/> <br/>Someone once gave me advice on how to use tilting effectively in a photograph. Told me that anything between 0 and 10% was a mistake. That it would look like an accident, and that it would come across as just sloppiness.  If you choose to use it to effect, always go above 10% in your grade.<br/> <br/>Of course, I never figured out how to measure it effectively. lol.<br/> <br/>Anyway, there''s some clarification for my original thoughts, which are my opinion only.</td>', 'Following up on my comment: Sorry about the rather opinionated comment. I''ve been trying to word my comments better than the one I left you, and meant to come back and refine it, but somehow missed doing so. What most of your commenters had to say rings true.  The tilt is a distraction here, and the photo could have been much stronger with just a little change of perspective, or even just a rotation in post-process.  Someone once gave me advice on how to use tilting effectively in a photograph. Told me that anything between 0 and 10% was a mistake. That it would look like an accident, and that it would come across as just sloppiness.  If you choose to use it to effect, always go above 10% in your grade. Of course, I never figured out how to measure it effectively. lol. Anyway, there''s some clarification for my original thoughts, which are my opinion only.', '2008-08-18 17:34:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4895900, 708166, 97166, '<td valign="top">Following up on my comment:<br/> <br/>I''m sorry that my comment wasn''t helpful to you, but it was just what I was feeling when I viewed it, and had no real reason other than pure first-impression. Unfortunately, first impression seems to be a very important aspect here.</td>', 'Following up on my comment: I''m sorry that my comment wasn''t helpful to you, but it was just what I was feeling when I viewed it, and had no real reason other than pure first-impression. Unfortunately, first impression seems to be a very important aspect here.', '2008-08-18 17:36:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4895905, 708854, 97166, '<td valign="top">Following up on my comment:<br/> <br/>Sorry that my comment wasn''t helpful. I''ll try to expand.<br/> <br/>The vignetting, as it is, is very strong and distracts from the focal point of the photo. This is why I didn''t like it, and should have explained. My apologies.<br/> <br/>Also, and this is something I didn''t really think about originally, there is only a very slim connection with the challenge here.  I don''t imagine you are pulling a paycheck from trying to get a 9+ score on DPC, so it really doesn''t fit as an occupation. <br/> <br/>Just my thoughts.</td>', 'Following up on my comment: Sorry that my comment wasn''t helpful. I''ll try to expand. The vignetting, as it is, is very strong and distracts from the focal point of the photo. This is why I didn''t like it, and should have explained. My apologies. Also, and this is something I didn''t really think about originally, there is only a very slim connection with the challenge here.  I don''t imagine you are pulling a paycheck from trying to get a 9+ score on DPC, so it really doesn''t fit as an occupation.  Just my thoughts.', '2008-08-18 17:39:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4895919, 708913, 30982, '<td valign="top">I very much like this!  You really do seem to have a way with the horse - it is quite intent on listening to whatever you''re telling it.  Probably "no carrots for you if you don''t pose!" or something to that effect.</td>', 'I very much like this!  You really do seem to have a way with the horse - it is quite intent on listening to whatever you''re telling it.  Probably "no carrots for you if you don''t pose!" or something to that effect.', '2008-08-18 17:44:51.000000', NULL, 0),
