(4902017, 708895, 52549, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by yanko:</b></div><hr/><i> <b>Irene Fun Fact #2: Super Woman</b> <br/> <br/>Irene started out a house of fire winning in her very first challenge at DPC and picking up her second in just her 4th challenge. However, afterwards something happened. For some unknown reason she lost her powers. 45 challenges went by without Irene on the front page. DPC nearly collapsed as it slipped into a dark age. Then like a beacon of light she re-emerges and the Irene Dynasty begins and continues to this day. <br/> <br/>Still people (i.e. me) question what truly happened. Why did she lose her powers? One person (i.e. me) wonders if it had something to do with her time on the Outcasts team back in the WPL/DPL days. Their captain (i.e. me) would have welcomed all those ribbons during those hard fought weeks the team had against it''s bitter rivals. Surely they would have won multiple championships during that time if only Irene had worn the cape she wears now. The world (i.e. me) will never forgive her for this. <br/> <br/>:P </i></td></tr></table> <br/>My dear Outcasts Captain... in the "lost my powers" phase I was watching and learning ;-) AND don''t forget I saved our asses by winning with this little beauty during the most critical end phase of the WPL <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=440344" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/602/120/440344.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/602/120/440344.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/602/120/440344.jpg"/></a> which gave me/us my highest score to date, so don''t be too hard on me :P</td>', 'Originally posted by yanko: Irene Fun Fact #2: Super Woman  Irene started out a house of fire winning in her very first challenge at DPC and picking up her second in just her 4th challenge. However, afterwards something happened. For some unknown reason she lost her powers. 45 challenges went by without Irene on the front page. DPC nearly collapsed as it slipped into a dark age. Then like a beacon of light she re-emerges and the Irene Dynasty begins and continues to this day.  Still people (i.e. me) question what truly happened. Why did she lose her powers? One person (i.e. me) wonders if it had something to do with her time on the Outcasts team back in the WPL/DPL days. Their captain (i.e. me) would have welcomed all those ribbons during those hard fought weeks the team had against it''s bitter rivals. Surely they would have won multiple championships during that time if only Irene had worn the cape she wears now. The world (i.e. me) will never forgive her for this.  :P  My dear Outcasts Captain... in the "lost my powers" phase I was watching and learning ;-) AND don''t forget I saved our asses by winning with this little beauty during the most critical end phase of the WPL  which gave me/us my highest score to date, so don''t be too hard on me :P', '2008-08-21 04:21:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4903361, 708815, 96721, '<td valign="top">jtf6agent just a quick follow up on my vote stage comment.<br/> <br/>I still think this is a wonderful shot even though I put the comment in about the knuckles I certainly did not vote you low because of it (I gave you a 7 for what it''s worth).<br/> <br/>Something I have just noticed is that there is only 2 tenths seperating 16th place and 27th place and you seem to have been hit hardest by voters <b>without</b> cameras (far, far harder than anyone 10 places in front of you, not sure why this would be though) :(<br/> <br/>Good luck for future entries (I hope to see your work again soon).</td>', 'jtf6agent just a quick follow up on my vote stage comment. I still think this is a wonderful shot even though I put the comment in about the knuckles I certainly did not vote you low because of it (I gave you a 7 for what it''s worth). Something I have just noticed is that there is only 2 tenths seperating 16th place and 27th place and you seem to have been hit hardest by voters without cameras (far, far harder than anyone 10 places in front of you, not sure why this would be though) :( Good luck for future entries (I hope to see your work again soon).', '2008-08-21 19:53:04.000000', NULL, 0),
