(4940458, 708207, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''ve been wanting to comment on this for a while and now I finally have a chance to do so.  I had no idea to what lengths you would go to serve your country hahaha.  (I read your first set of comments that you had and I already know what you do but I could not resist writing that! hehe)<br/> <br/>Beautiful capture of lines and I love the clarity.  Your perspective creates this dizzying effect too. Congrats on a great score!</td>', 'I''ve been wanting to comment on this for a while and now I finally have a chance to do so.  I had no idea to what lengths you would go to serve your country hahaha.  (I read your first set of comments that you had and I already know what you do but I could not resist writing that! hehe) Beautiful capture of lines and I love the clarity.  Your perspective creates this dizzying effect too. Congrats on a great score!', '2008-09-07 20:36:31.000000', NULL, 0),
