(4961744, 708701, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ok, now I''m even more impressed.   You win a ribbon with a brand new lens . . . and you teach MATH and PHYSICS!!!   Sheeeeeeeeesh.  You are truly THE MAN!!!   I shudder at so much as a thought of having to do a math problem.   I made an A in my college Algebra class, then the minute the grades came out, so much relief drained out of me that all the math info did too.  Imediately.   :)    Great photo for this challenge too.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ok, now I''m even more impressed.   You win a ribbon with a brand new lens . . . and you teach MATH and PHYSICS!!!   Sheeeeeeeeesh.  You are truly THE MAN!!!   I shudder at so much as a thought of having to do a math problem.   I made an A in my college Algebra class, then the minute the grades came out, so much relief drained out of me that all the math info did too.  Imediately.   :)    Great photo for this challenge too. ', '2008-09-18 13:38:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4967104, 709007, 66494, '<td valign="top">Nice shot Jeffrey, I didn''t vote this challenge ... and I decided to poke around your site and see what you''d been up to lately.<br/>I have to admit ... I don''t think I would have picked you out during voting ... I guess you''re just too far away for me to have recognized you.<br/>Nice idea and very nice completion. <br/>I just made reservations for visiting the area ... will PM you with details soon.</td>', 'Nice shot Jeffrey, I didn''t vote this challenge ... and I decided to poke around your site and see what you''d been up to lately.I have to admit ... I don''t think I would have picked you out during voting ... I guess you''re just too far away for me to have recognized you.Nice idea and very nice completion. I just made reservations for visiting the area ... will PM you with details soon.', '2008-09-21 21:59:41.000000', NULL, 0),
